<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<xri version="1.0">
   <!-- PIAdvisor PixInsight Update Repository -->
   <description>
      <p>PIAdvisor update feed for PixInsight.</p>
      <p>Status: Public package v1.5.0 published on 2026-10-15 17:29:09 UTC.</p>
      <p>A rebuilt chat, live image measurements, and easier image sharing on Windows and Linux.</p>
      <p>Changelog: https://piadvisor.net/changelog/</p>
   </description>
   <platform os="windows" arch="x64" version="1.8.9:1.9.4">
      <package fileName="packages/PIAdvisor-windows-x64-1.5.0-20261015172818.zip" sha1="c56372d5425bda65107a17ddea722eb6de476b17" releaseDate="20261015172818" type="module">
         <title>PIAdvisor Module v1.5.0</title>
         <remove>bin/PIAdvisor-pxm.dll
bin/PIAdvisor-pxm.xsgn
doc/tools/PIAdvisor/PIAdvisor.html</remove>
         <description>
            <p>A rebuilt chat, live image measurements, and easier image sharing on Windows and Linux.</p>
            <p>Highlights:</p>
            <p>- Rebuilt the chat and message input: full-width messages, matching PixInsight light and dark themes, clearer message controls, and one-click Markdown copying. New Chat shows a welcome guide with provider setup and formatting examples.</p>
            <p>- Long conversations load older messages as you scroll and keep your reading position.</p>
            <p>- Live image measurements. With &quot;Let the advisor fetch image data&quot; on, PIAdvisor can measure your open images during a reply: star FWHM and eccentricity, background noise and gradients, statistics, stretch predictions, history entries, process parameters and FITS keywords. Star measurements use PixInsight&apos;s built-in star detection and PSF fitting. Measurements run in the background and never change your images.</p>
            <p>- A live Checking line shows what PIAdvisor is measuring. Show measured values opens the exact results, and follow-up questions keep key measurements until the image changes. In each measuring round, PIAdvisor can take several measurements at once. Free allows 2 rounds per reply. Pro and Trial allow up to 12.</p>
            <p>- Exact settings come from your installation: before PIAdvisor suggests settings for a process, it can read that process&apos;s parameter names, ranges and options from your PixInsight.</p>
            <p>- Paste PNG or JPEG screenshots directly into the chat input with Ctrl+V on Windows and Linux. Images appear in the draft attachment ribbon without sending or replacing your text. You can also send an image without a written message.</p>
            <p>- Click an attached image to open a separate, resizable viewer. Click to zoom around the pointer, drag to pan, then click again to fit the whole image. Originals stay local at their imported or captured resolution; the model receives resized images. Imports run in the background.</p>
            <p>- Each reply shows how long it took, including measuring.</p>
            <p>- A line under each reply shows token usage, cached tokens and request count; OpenRouter also reports cost. Conversation requests reuse provider prompt caching where supported to reduce repeated processing and cost.</p>
            <p>- About my setup in LLM Settings saves your gear and preferences, such as processes you avoid, and includes them with every request.</p>
            <p>- Updated advisor guidance names problems first and backs findings with measurements.</p>
            <p>- If you changed the system prompt or the formatting template, PIAdvisor offers the new prompts at startup and saves a copy of yours first.</p>
            <p>- Better provider compatibility and clearer error messages.</p>
            <p>- Fixes for measuring, message text, history-preview privacy and license activation.</p>
            <p>Changelog: https://piadvisor.net/changelog/</p>
         </description>
      </package>
   </platform>
